<title>HUNGARY: FORECAST-Hungary bond yields seen up, bills mixed.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-Hungary bond yields seen up, bills mixed.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian government bond yields were seen rising at this week's auctions, dealers said on Monday, while their opinions about how Treasury bill yields would change were divided.</p>
<p>The Government Debt Management Agency will auction one-month T-bills on Tuesday, three-month T-bills on Wednesday, three-year government bonds of the 2000/E series and seven-year bonds of the 2004/F series on Thursday.</p>
